stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> CreateDir
    CreateDir --> CreateTemp
    CreateTemp --> Write
    Write --> FileSync
    FileSync --> Observe: complete file synced (Unix and Windows)
    Observe --> Rename: upper inflight diagnostic if applicable
    Rename --> Published: rename succeeds
    Published --> [*]: Ok; parent sync not requested
    CreateDir --> NotPublished: io error
    CreateTemp --> NotPublished: io error
    Write --> NotPublished: io error
    FileSync --> NotPublished: io error
    Rename --> NotPublished: io error; diagnostic already emitted
    NotPublished --> [*]: upper ENOSPC record if errno 28; Err(stage, io error)
    note right of Published
      Separate S07 parent sync capability:
      Unix flushes; Windows Ok but unflushed.
      Plain atomic_write never calls it.
    end note
